  <data key="d0">Tuition Fee</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Tuition Fee is the cost of enrollment in the ISS program, which can be reduced through scholarships such as the Re-registration Benefit and Kingo Family Scholarship.&lt;SEP&gt;Tuition Fee refers to the cost of ISS courses, paid by participants via Flywire.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60e103e0807596240e5b01989129e459&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7f2c602b863e29ddf14e816b366b63a</data>
