</node>
<node id="International Summer Semester (ISS)">
  <data key="d0">International Summer Semester (ISS)</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The International Summer Semester (ISS) is a global academic program established in 2008 by SKKU. It is one of the most diverse and successful summer programs in Asia, attracting thousands of students from around the world.&lt;SEP&gt;The International Summer Semester (ISS) is an intensive four-week educational program held annually, renowned for its excellence and cultural exchange opportunities.&lt;SEP&gt;The International Summer Semester (ISS) is an academic program held at Sungkyunkwan University, providing educational opportunities during the summer.&lt;SEP&gt;The International Summer Semester is a four-week academic program at SKKU designed to immerse participants in Seoul's culture, history, and global perspectives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-16cbcaef78bf936a584694124dc66335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45a15143e8df6450c9849e2093a471e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57fb0c405e40135c786d43153b76d85f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e3a26b706037b160f708ed8cd8a076</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749108471</data>
</node>
<node id="2025 ISS Program">
  <data key="d0">2025 ISS Program</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The 2025 ISS Program is the 17th iteration of the International Summer Semester, running from June 27th to July 25th, featuring academic lectures and cultural activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0e3a26b706037b160f708ed8cd8a076</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749108207</data>
</node>
<node id="Gyeongbokgung Palace">
  <data key="d0">Gyeongbokgung Palace</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Gyeongbokgung Palace is a historic landmark in Korea, included in the ISS program's cultural immersion activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Gyeongbokgung Palace is a stunning 14th-century royal residence from the Joseon Dynasty, showcasing Korea's historical heritage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1762ac0fbba96e0d0750be6c2f7f02a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e3a26b706037b160f708ed8cd8a076</data>
