  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Korean Culture encompasses the traditions, practices, and experiences offered through the cultural activities in the Pre-Session Program.&lt;SEP&gt;Korean culture is a central focus of the ISS program, with activities designed to deepen participants' appreciation and understanding.</data>
