<node id="Sungkyunkwan University">
  <data key="d0">Sungkyunkwan University</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Sungkyunkwan University (SKKU) is a globally recognized academic institution hosting the ISS Research Internship.&lt;SEP&gt;Sungkyunkwan University is the institution offering the program and handling payments through its designated banking branch and virtual account system.&lt;SEP&gt;Sungkyunkwan University, located in Seoul, is a prestigious educational institution with a rich history dating back to the Joseon Dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;Sungkyunkwan University is a prestigious academic institution in South Korea with campuses specializing in Humanities, Social Sciences, and Natural Sciences.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b32476eb690014ac253e96d5f68e5878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16cbcaef78bf936a584694124dc66335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f24e89350b05126a3c95d917db3b098&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b62f790fb108b029553fbfebbf5d074b</data>
