  <data key="d5">1749108221</data>
</node>
<node id="Flywire">
  <data key="d0">Flywire</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Flywire is a payment platform used by ISS participants to pay tuition and application fees, with payments processed weekly.&lt;SEP&gt;Flywire is an online payment platform that facilitates international transactions, offering competitive exchange rates and tracking options.&lt;SEP&gt;Flywire is the payment platform used by ISS 2025 students to pay the program fee for the Jeju Cultural Journey.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bfebb1097a2e216f52589d6879b9f3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b62f790fb108b029553fbfebbf5d074b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60e103e0807596240e5b01989129e459</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749108460</data>
</node>
<node id="Application Fee">
  <data key="d0">Application Fee</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Application Fee refers to the fee paid by students to enroll in the ISS program, processed through Flywire.&lt;SEP&gt;The Application Fee is a mandatory non-refundable payment of 100,000 KRW required during the registration process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60e103e0807596240e5b01989129e459&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b62f790fb108b029553fbfebbf5d074b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749108424</data>
</node>
<node id="Tuition">
  <data key="d0">Tuition</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Tuition costs for the program vary based on the number of courses, ranging from 1,600,000 KRW to 3,400,000 KRW.&lt;SEP&gt;Tuition refers to the fee paid by students, which includes the cost of SKKU Group Insurance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65141db8aa8fdc715a2f319ecdc219df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b62f790fb108b029553fbfebbf5d074b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749108494</data>
</node>
<node id="Dormitory Fee">
  <data key="d0">Dormitory Fee</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Dormitory Fee is an optional payment of 900,000 KRW for accommodation during the program.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dormitory Fee for the Pre-Session Program is KRW 450,000, covering accommodation costs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b62f790fb108b029553fbfebbf5d074b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-453d6bb05d33b6f247bd6320ae324c7d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749108346</data>
</node>
<node id="Group Insurance Fee">
  <data key="d0">Group Insurance Fee</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Group Insurance Fee is an optional payment of 50,000 KRW for insurance coverage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b62f790fb108b029553fbfebbf5d074b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749108221</data>
</node>
