</node>
<node id="Seoul">
  <data key="d0">Seoul</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Seoul, the capital city of South Korea, is a vibrant metropolis with a rich history spanning over 600 years. Renowned as one of the world’s greatest cities, it is celebrated for its dynamic culture, historic significance, and tourism opportunities, including attractions like Everland and Caribbean Bay. Seoul serves as a hub for education, research, and social activities, hosting institutions such as Sungkyunkwan University (SKKU). Specifically, it is home to SKKU's Humanities and Social Sciences Campus in the Jongno-gu district, as well as dormitories and facilities for the university's International Summer Semester (ISS) program. The city also supports research activities for the ISS Research Internship and houses organizations like Aird and the Seoul Global Center. With its blend of cultural heritage, academic prominence, and modern amenities, Seoul continues to attract visitors and scholars from around the globe.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-16cbcaef78bf936a584694124dc66335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91964e73ecc4c81dd05b467f5d7acf2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e806d65c28cb060fad6e0ba22951f523&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f24e89350b05126a3c95d917db3b098&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee86da05db26bc26419fc8a7bb74a441&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705e6f932ff9b6ca5e3309b8b752c9d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1762ac0fbba96e0d0750be6c2f7f02a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57fb0c405e40135c786d43153b76d85f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b62f790fb108b029553fbfebbf5d074b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3457dc75245cff92375986dd67ca52e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45a15143e8df6450c9849e2093a471e9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1749108476</data>
</node>
