  <data key="d0">Joseon Dynasty</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Joseon Dynasty was a Korean dynastic kingdom (1392-1910) during which many of Seoul's historic landmarks, including palaces and walls, were constructed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Joseon Dynasty was a historical period in Korea during which Gyeongbokgung Palace was built as the main royal residence.</data>
