  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Engineering is a category of courses offered within the ISS Program, focusing on technical, scientific, and engineering principles applied to design, construction, and various engineering disciplines. It includes courses such as Fluid Mechanics and Thermodynamics, which provide academic credits. Additionally, Engineering is a field of research available at the Suwon campus as part of the ISS Research Internship.</data>
