<node id="Academic Credits">
  <data key="d0">Academic Credits</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Academic Credits are earned by ISS participants through interdisciplinary courses, contributing to their academic initiatives and global education.&lt;SEP&gt;Academic Credits are units of measurement for coursework in the ISS Program, determining the workload and study requirements for each course.&lt;SEP&gt;Academic Credits refer to the measurement of course workload, with ISS courses providing 3 credits and Korean Language courses providing 2 credits.</data>
