  <data key="d2">Study Hours refer to the daily time commitment required for ISS courses (3 hours per day) and Korean Language courses (2 hours per day).&lt;SEP&gt;Study Hours refer to the daily time commitment students must fulfill for each course, varying based on the number of academic credits.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f59ec17f08b561b76ce546e31586bb9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c431f4ad10d3d717f10b55808b36752</data>
