  <data key="d2">ISS (International Summer School) is an educational program organizing cultural and academic activities for enrolled students, including the Jeju Cultural Journey.&lt;SEP&gt;ISS refers to the International Summer School, a program for which various accommodation options are provided.&lt;SEP&gt;ISS refers to the International Summer Semester, a program offering courses for undergraduate students, including Korean language proficiency tests and academic credit transfer opportunities.&lt;SEP&gt;The ISS (International Summer Semester) is a program offered by SKKU for students, with specific housing arrangements provided.</data>
